  message: "Fixed in PR #581 (session-scoped autouse ensure_discovered fixture; core + repo-root conftest); deployed dev 4091f00ffd. Behavioral evidence: the deterministic repro (7 core test files incl. test_emission_parity_matrix under -n auto) went 9 failed + 79 errors (KeyError none-registered) -> 401 passed, stable across 4 runs. END-TO-END: the same wide 90-file affected-slice that blocked PR #579 with 81 failed + 34 errors now passes 3735 passed / 0 failed / 0 errors with 100% changed-source coverage on dev, fixture present (PR #579 merged 349d932003). Residual (per description, No-Weasel): a destructive clear_registry-without-restore test would still leak _discovered=True + empty; none exists in the current suite; deeper fix = ensure_discovered recovers a cleared registry from a persistent known-set."  # 3cff
